note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The dequantization of one weight-row run of omega_gpu_gemm_ex_fp8_block_rows (CUDApp#144,
note src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c l.467-476): d[c] = f32(((f64 e4m3 w[c]) * (f64 sr[cb])) * scale_mul), one rounding,
note cb = (c0 + c) / block ((cb + 1) % kb under mutant 5).
note q: 0 cn (<= 16383), 1 c0, 2 block, 3 kb, 4 scale_mul f64 bits, 5 mutant, 6 sbase = c0 / block, 7 sr[0] bits;
note s[i] = sr[sbase + i] and d[c] as binary32 bits (the C shell copies min(16384, kb - sbase) entries). Gives 0, or 1 for a block outside s.
fn gemm_ex_fp8 q view ulong 8 w view uchar 65536 s view uchar 65536 d edit uchar 65536 to ulong
bl = get q 2
sb = get q 6
for c ulong get q 0
cb = div add get q 1 c bl
if eq get q 5 5
cb = rem add cb 1 get q 3
end
sv = get q 7
if ge cb sb
if ge sub cb sb 16384
ret 1
end
sv = ulong gx_get view s sub cb sb 4
end
if and lt cb sb ne cb 0
ret 1
end
x = f64 gx_e4m3 uint get w c
x = mul x f64 bitcast f32 uint sv
x = mul x bitcast f64 get q 4
gx_put edit d c 4 bitcast uint f32 x
end
ret 0
end
